{"unit":8,"items":20,"pass":14,"title":"Final Test · Unit 8","html":"\n  <section class=\"stage on\" data-stage=\"Final Test\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Unit 8 &middot; Final Test &middot; end of level</div>\n      <h2>Out in the world</h2>\n      <p>Twenty questions on Lessons 19&ndash;24: caf&eacute;, shopping, weather, invitations, the past. Answer them all, then press Check. You need <b>14 out of 20</b> to pass &mdash; and you can take this test as many times as you like. This is the last test of the level.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"review-u8\">\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Part 1 &middot; Grammar and vocabulary &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 1&ndash;15</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">Choose the correct answer.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">I'd ___ a coffee, please.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">like</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">likes</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">want</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">Do you have ___ juice?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">any</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">a</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">some</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">I'd like ___ chips.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">a</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">some</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">any</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">How ___ is the bag?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">much</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">often</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">many</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\">How ___ apples do you want?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">many</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">often</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">much</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\">It's five ___.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">dollares</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">dollar</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">dollars</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">7</span><span class=\"body\">It's ___ today. Take an umbrella!\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">rains</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">raining</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">rain</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">8</span><span class=\"body\">What's the ___ like?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">wear</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">weather</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">whether</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">9</span><span class=\"body\">___ go to the cinema!\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Let</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">We let</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Let's</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">10</span><span class=\"body\">Do you want ___ come?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">to</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">at</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">for</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">11</span><span class=\"body\">Call ___ tomorrow, OK?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">my</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">I</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">me</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">12</span><span class=\"body\">I ___ at home yesterday.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">am</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">was</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">were</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">13</span><span class=\"body\">You ___ at school last week.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">are</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">was</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">were</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">14</span><span class=\"body\">Yesterday I ___ football.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">play</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">played</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">playd</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">15</span><span class=\"body\">We ___ to the park on Sunday.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">go</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">goed</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">went</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" style=\"margin-top:26px\">Part 2 &middot; Write the answer &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 16&ndash;20</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">Type your answer. Spelling counts; capital letters and full stops do not. &middot; В письменных ответах важна орфография; заглавные буквы и точки &mdash; нет.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">16</span><span class=\"body\">Order politely: tea<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"I'd like a tea, please.|I'd like some tea, please.\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">17</span><span class=\"body\">Ask the price: the bag<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"How much is the bag?\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">18</span><span class=\"body\">Make it past: I am at work.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"I was at work.\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">19</span><span class=\"body\">Make it past: We eat pizza.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"We ate pizza.\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">20</span><span class=\"body\">Ask: What / you / do yesterday<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"What did you do yesterday?\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n\n      <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"checkReview(this)\" style=\"margin-top:24px\">Check my answers</button>\n      <div class=\"res\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div id=\"reviewResult\" class=\"review-result\"></div>\n  </section>\n"}